    recordCasinoReward, casinoRewardReceipt, casinoRewardEffects, importCasinoScore, casinoScore, recordCasinoScore, loginExplorerRequestReceipt, expeditionItemEffects, expeditionColdRecovery, giftItemRewards, pendingCappedGachaTicket, giftClaimGuard, giftDelivery, giftStaminaRecovery, takarakujiGiftTickets, recordAchievementCharacters, achievementPcDelivery,
